$MDESC::Type = "CTF Spawn";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Tyr's Cradle" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Cold, Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The Tribe Lord has become bored with the normal games. He has rounded up the two best Tribe teams and thrown them into the prison on Tyr's Cradle. Now each team must battle it out to the death for this fast paced game of CTF. The final victor of the match becomes the new Tribal Lords and leaders of all!" @
	 "\n\n<f1>Made By:<f0> LL Kunochi - Optimizer. Download all my maps at www.xtremegaming.net Check weekly for new maps!" @
	 "\n\n<f1>Special Thanks:<f0> All my thanks goes out to Watchman over at TribeOne." ;